      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Small update - certainly something to do with earmuffs. While it is visible in world, turning earmuffs off removes the ring. Turning earmuffs back on doesn't bring the ring back. So it's more on an 'on world load' thing I guess.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
