      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Some more replication info...\nReplicated in desktop with earmuffs both on and off. Persisted after world reload.\nAfter a game restart with earmuffs disabled, I'm unable to replicate further, even with option spamming.\nAfter a restart with earmuffs *enabled*, it shows up, but I was able to make it disappear by repeatedly enabling and disabling earmuffs.\nVideo of ring present in desktop ~(at 0,2,0 of world) - https://gfycat.com/oblongaccuratecrownofthornsstarfish",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
